+    "summary": "Greptile on PR #105 (MAR-2922): when documenting that several CLI positionals form one search query, the dash rule must cover every query word, not only the first.",
+    "mistake": "The contract said to use -- before a query beginning with a dash, but node:util parseArgs also treats a later unquoted word such as -output as an option.",
